#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:2
msgid "Creating Roles"
msgstr "Creando Roles"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:5
msgid "User Roles"
msgstr "Roles de Usuario"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:7
msgid ""
"User Roles can be single or multitenant. A Multitenant User Role is "
"automatically copied into all existing subtenants as well as placed into "
"a subtenant when created. Useful for providing a set of predefined roles "
"a Customer can use. The Multitenant Locked option prevent subtenant from "
"modifying FEATURE ACCESS settings in the Role. Note Group, Instance Type "
"and Blueprint Access settings will still be editable as Groups are unique"
" per Tenant, and Instance and Blueprints can be a mix of unique and "
"shared items."
msgstr ""
"Roles de Usuario puede ser single o multiinquilino. Un Multiinquilino Rol"
" de Usuario es automáticamente copied en todos existente subinquilinos "
"así como placed en a subinquilino cuando creado. Useful para providing a "
"establecido de predefined roles a Customer puede usar. El Multiinquilino "
"Locked opción prevent subinquilino desde modifying FEATURE ACCESS "
"configuración en el Rol. Note Grupo, Tipo de Instancia y Blueprint Acceso"
" configuración va a still be editable as Grupos son único per Inquilino, "
"y Instancia y Blueprints puede ser a mix de único y shared items."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:9
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:46
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:9
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:46
msgid ""
"Multitenant Roles still need to be configured/managed be each subtenant, "
"as Groups are unique per Tenant, and Instance and Blueprints can be a mix"
" of unique and shared items."
msgstr ""
"Multiinquilino Roles still need a be configurado/gestionado be cada "
"subinquilino, as Grupos son único per Inquilino, y Instancia y Blueprints"
" puede ser a mix de único y shared items."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:11
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:48
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:11
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:48
msgid ""
"User Roles cannot exceed Tenant Role permissions. If a Multitenant User "
"Role has higher permissions than the Tenant Role assigned to a subtenant,"
" the Multitenant User Role permissions in that Tenant will automatically "
"be reduced to match the Tenant Role permissions."
msgstr ""
"Roles de Usuario cannot exceed Rol de Inquilino permisos. Si a "
"Multiinquilino Rol de Usuario tiene higher permisos than el Rol de "
"Inquilino asignado a a subinquilino, el Multiinquilino Rol de Usuario "
"permisos en ese Inquilino va a automáticamente be reduced a match el Rol "
"de Inquilino permisos."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:15
msgid "Create a Single Tenant User Role"
msgstr "Crear a Single Inquilino Rol de Usuario"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:17
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:33
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:58
msgid "In the Master Account, navigate to |AdmRol|"
msgstr "En el Master Cuenta, navegue a |AdmRol|"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:18
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:34
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:59
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ CREATE ROLE`"
msgstr "Seleccionar :guilabel:`+ CREATE ROLE`"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:19
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:35
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:60
msgid "Enter a name for the Role and optional Description"
msgstr "Enter a nombre para el Rol y optional Description"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:20
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:36
msgid "For TYPE, select \"User Role\""
msgstr "Para TYPE, seleccionar \"Rol de Usuario\""

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:21
msgid "Leave the \"Multi-tenant Role\" checkbox blank."
msgstr "Leave el \"Multi-inquilino Rol\" casilla de verificación blank."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:22
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:37
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:62
msgid ""
"Optionally select an existing Role to copy in the COPY FROM ROLE "
"dropdown. * This will configure the new Role with the same configuration "
"as the selected role to copy. A new role that is not copied from another "
"role will be generated with all permissions set to NONE."
msgstr ""
"Optionally seleccionar un existente Rol a copy en el COPY FROM ROLE menú "
"desplegable. * Este va a configure el nuevo Rol con el mismo "
"configuración as el seleccionado rol a copy. Un nuevo rol ese es no "
"copied desde another rol será generated con todos permisos establecido a "
"NONE."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:24
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:42
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:64
msgid "Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Seleccionar :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:26
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:44
msgid ""
"After saving the Role will be created, and you will be redirected to the "
"Roles Permissions settings."
msgstr ""
"Después de saving el Rol será creado, y usted será redirected a el Roles "
"Permisos configuración."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:29
msgid "Create a MultiTenant User Role"
msgstr "Crear a MultiInquilino Rol de Usuario"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:31
msgid ""
"A Multitenant User Role is automatically copied into all existing "
"subtenants as well as placed into a subtenant when created. Useful for "
"providing a set of predefined roles a Customer can use. The Multitenant "
"Locked option prevent subtenant from modifying FEATURE ACCESS settings in"
" the Role. Note Group, Instance Type and Blueprint Access settings will "
"still be editable as Groups are unique per Tenant, and Instance and "
"Blueprints can be a mix of unique and shared items."
msgstr ""
"Un Multiinquilino Rol de Usuario es automáticamente copied en todos "
"existente subinquilinos así como placed en a subinquilino cuando creado. "
"Useful para providing a establecido de predefined roles a Customer puede "
"usar. El Multiinquilino Locked opción prevent subinquilino desde "
"modifying FEATURE ACCESS configuración en el Rol. Note Grupo, Tipo de "
"Instancia y Blueprint Acceso configuración va a still be editable as "
"Grupos son único per Inquilino, y Instancia y Blueprints puede ser a mix "
"de único y shared items."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:39
msgid "Select the MULTITENANT ROLE checkbox"
msgstr "Seleccione el MULTITENANT ROLE casilla de verificación"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:40
msgid ""
"Optionally select the MULTITENANT LOCKED checkbox * When enabled, the "
"FEATURE ACCESS settings in the Role will not be editable by subtenants. "
"Group, Instance Type and Blueprint Access settings will still be editable"
" as Groups are unique per Tenant, and Instance and Blueprints can be a "
"mix of unique and shared items."
msgstr ""
"Optionally seleccione el MULTITENANT LOCKED casilla de verificación * "
"Cuando está habilitado, el FEATURE ACCESS configuración en el Rol no be "
"editable por subinquilinos. Grupo, Tipo de Instancia y Blueprint Acceso "
"configuración va a still be editable as Grupos son único per Inquilino, y"
" Instancia y Blueprints puede ser a mix de único y shared items."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:51
msgid "Tenant Roles"
msgstr "Roles de Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:53
msgid ""
"A Tenant Role sets the highest possible permissions for a Tenant. User "
"Roles within that Tenant cannot exceed those of the Tenants assigned "
"Tenant Role. Tenant Roles can be assigned to single or multiple Tenants, "
"and do not apply to the Master Account."
msgstr ""
"Un Rol de Inquilino sets el highest possible permisos para a Inquilino. "
"Roles de Usuario dentro de ese Inquilino cannot exceed esos de el "
"Inquilinos asignado Rol de Inquilino. Roles de Inquilino puede ser "
"asignado a single o múltiples Inquilinos, y hacer no aplicar a el Master "
"Cuenta."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:56
msgid "To create a Tenant Role:"
msgstr "Un crear a Rol de Inquilino:"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:61
msgid "For TYPE, select \"Tenant Role\""
msgstr "Para TYPE, seleccionar \"Rol de Inquilino\""

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:66
msgid ""
"After saving, the Role will be created and you will be redirected to the "
"Roles Permissions settings."
msgstr ""
"Después de saving, el Rol será creado y usted será redirected a el Roles "
"Permisos configuración."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:69
msgid "Setting an Optional Landing URL"
msgstr "Setting un Optional Landing URL"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:71
msgid ""
"On login, by default, Users will land on the Dashboard page (|OpeDas|). "
"However, User and Tenant Roles may have custom landing URLs set. Setting "
"a custom landing URL on the Tenant Role will apply globally to all Users "
"within the Tenant. Landing URLs set on the User Role will supersede the "
"landing URL set on the Tenant Role (if any). No Tenant Role is applied to"
" the |master tenant| so the custom landing URL can only be set on the "
"User Role for these Users."
msgstr ""
"En inicio de sesión, de forma predeterminada, Usuarios va a land en el "
"Dashboard página (|OpeDas|). Sin embargo, Usuario y Roles de Inquilino "
"puede tienen personalizado landing URLs establecido. Setting a "
"personalizado landing URL en el Rol de Inquilino va a aplicar globally a "
"todos Usuarios dentro de el Inquilino. Landing URLs establecido en el Rol"
" de Usuario va a supersede el landing URL establecido en el Rol de "
"Inquilino (si cualquier). No Rol de Inquilino es aplicado a el |master "
"inquilino| so el personalizado landing URL puede solo be establecido en "
"el Rol de Usuario para estos Usuarios."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:73
msgid ""
"To set a custom landing URL, create or edit a Role. Set the custom "
"landing URL in the \"LANDING URL\" field. For example, set "
"``/provisioning/instances`` and the Users having that Role will land on "
"the Instances list page each time they log in. Other paths may be used "
"depending on the desired landing page."
msgstr ""
"Un establecido a personalizado landing URL, crear o editar a Rol. "
"Establecido el personalizado landing URL en el \"LANDING URL\" campo. Por"
" ejemplo, establecido ``/provisioning/instancias`` y el Usuarios having "
"ese Rol va a land en el Instancias lista página cada time ellos log en. "
"Otro paths puede be usado dependiendo de el desired landing página."

